{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S01、S04-S06：前半段较多聚焦于害怕暴露自己的需要、被嫌黏或破坏相处自在，具体的表达顾虑略显突出。\",\n    \"S03、S10：短暂偏向单纯享受当下的亲近，留不住这份幸福的痛楚有所淡化。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S07、S09、S11-S14：反复把幸福建立在对方也需要他、他能让对方安心之上，把失去亲近的痛楚具体化为有一天不再被需要的恐惧。\",\n    \"这种互相需要的确认逐渐成为主线，使原本更宽广的亲密幸福与无法留住它之间的矛盾，收窄成了关于自身是否被需要的顾虑。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X虽然有些段落偏重表达心意的顾虑，但整体仍围绕亲近本身的甜蜜、对它消逝的预感，以及越想珍惜越无法保证留住的矛盾展开。Y对幸福与痛楚的交织写得更紧，却反复以互相需要和害怕不再被需要来定义这份亲密，因而略微偏离了Center更宽广的核心。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "204bbb7d-860d-4dd6-8029-8e40a14f8801", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T100911446920Z", "elapsed_seconds": 59.515, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:10:10.966803+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d72a42eab21c88e1f222e0ba9bb903bf0041321ffb55f3efc2d6f82d1bc1b3b1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa3